                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This a great example of a room scale game (requires at least 1.5x1.5 I'd say) that is simple yet fun, due to the audio narrative and the excellent haptic feedback you get while working on your Yenga style monuments.\n\nHighly recommended, since everything is stationary and one moves around the 1x1m tower in the middle the risk of getting motion sickness is really small.\n\nRuns well on a GTX 970 with an i5-2500k.",
